    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nTurnberry is a substantial detached family home set on an exceptional south-facing site within the highly regarded Brownstown development, just a short stroll from the heart of Ratoath Village. \n\nBuilt in 2003 and extending to approximately 260 sq.m. / 2,798 sq.ft., this architecturally designed residence offers spacious and versatile accommodation ideal for modern family living. Occupying a mature site of approximately 0.4 acres, the property enjoys excellent privacy together with beautifully landscaped gardens and multiple outdoor entertaining areas. \n\nThe accommodation is both practical and elegant, centred around a welcoming entrance hall with a series of well-proportioned reception rooms. A large family room and formal living room each feature solid fuel stoves, while the dining room connects seamlessly to both the kitchen and living space, creating an ideal layout for entertaining. The kitchen and breakfast area overlooks the gardens and is complemented by a separate utility room. A ground floor office, which could easily serve as a sixth bedroom, provides additional flexibility. \n\nUpstairs, the generous accommodation continues with five bedrooms, including an impressive principal suite complete with dressing area and en-suite bathroom. A family bathroom and separate shower room comfortably serve the remaining bedrooms.\n\nTurnberry represents a rare opportunity to acquire a substantial family home on one of the largest residential sites in Ratoath, combining privacy, space and convenience in equal measure.\n\nGardens & Grounds \n\n One of Turnberry's most impressive features is its exceptional site extending to approximately 0.4 acres. Positioned at the end of the development, it is arguably the finest site within Brownstown, offering enhanced privacy, a sense of exclusivity and ample parking. The elevated setting further enhances the beautifully landscaped south-facing gardens, which have been carefully designed to maximise sunlight throughout the day, making this a truly standout and prestigious home.\n\nMature trees, established planting and well-maintained lawns create a wonderful sense of seclusion rarely found within a village setting. A series of patio areas provide ideal spaces for outdoor dining and entertaining, while the extensive wraparound patio to the rear takes full advantage of the sunny aspect and can be accessed directly from several rooms within the house. \n\nTo the front, a generous driveway provides ample off-street parking and is framed by mature landscaping and attractive brick boundary walls, creating an impressive arrival to the property.\n\nLocation \n\nTurnberry enjoys a prime position within Brownstown, one of Ratoath's most sought-after residential addresses. Located within walking distance of Ratoath Village, residents can enjoy immediate access to an excellent range of amenities including schools, cafés, restaurants, shops and everyday services. Both SuperValu and the local GAA club are within easy walking distance, further enhancing the convenience of this exceptional location.\n \nRatoath is a thriving and well-established village with a strong sense of community and an excellent selection of sporting, recreational and educational facilities. The neighbouring towns of Dunshaughlin and Ashbourne are both approximately 6km away, providing an even wider range of shopping, dining and leisure amenities. \n\nFor commuters, the location is particularly appealing. The M2, M3 and M50 road networks are all easily accessible, offering straightforward access to Dublin City Centre, Dublin Airport and the wider Greater Dublin Area. Regular commuter bus services also operate from the village, making Turnberry an ideal choice for those seeking a balance between country-style living and city accessibility.\n\nProperties of this scale and standing on mature sites within such a convenient village setting rarely come to the market, making Turnberry a truly exceptional family home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nA bright and welcoming reception hall featuring timber flooring, decorative coving and archways leading to the principal reception rooms.\n\nFamily Room - \nLocated to the front of the property, this elegant reception room features a bay window, wood-burning stove and quality flooring, creating a warm and comfortable family space.\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Room - \nThe heart of the home, fitted with an extensive range of shaker-style units and ample worktop space. The adjoining breakfast area enjoys pleasant views across the rear gardens and direct access outside.\n\nUtility Room - \nPractical utility space with additional storage and external access.\n\nDining Room - \nA superb formal dining space overlooking the rear garden. Double doors connect through to the living room, allowing both rooms to function as one large entertaining area when required.\n\nLiving Room - \nA beautifully proportioned reception room positioned to the rear of the home with garden access and a feature limestone fireplace incorporating a stove.\n\nGuest WC - \nTastefully presented guest bathroom located off the entrance hall.\n\nHome Office / Bedroom 6 - \nA versatile room positioned to the front of the property, ideal as a home office, playroom or additional bedroom.\n\nLanding - \nA spacious central landing providing access to all first-floor accommodation and the attic staircase.\n\nPrincipal Bedroom - \nAn exceptionally generous bedroom suite featuring a bay window, dressing area with fitted wardrobes and a large en-suite bathroom.\n\nEn-Suite - \nWell-appointed en-suite incorporating bath, separate shower, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nLarge double bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nSpacious double bedroom overlooking the front garden.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nBright dual-aspect bedroom with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 5 - \nWell-proportioned bedroom suitable for a variety of uses.\n\nShower Room - \nFully fitted shower room serving the first-floor accommodation.\n\nFamily Bathroom - \nLarge family bathroom complete with bath, WC and wash hand basin.\n\n"
      },
